### .gitignore ###

# Claude Code

# Our global .gitignore has ".claude/" which would exclude this stow source
# entirely; re-include the directory before layering specific rules.
!claude/.claude/

# Keep CLAUDE.md, settings.json, and hooks; ignore everything else Claude creates
claude/.claude/*
!claude/.claude/CLAUDE.md
!claude/.claude/settings.json
!claude/.claude/hooks
!claude/.claude/hooks/**
